    "name": {
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "A row of notes in order, from one note up to the same note again an [[octave|octave]] higher, is a [[scale|scale]]. This one starts on C and has a bright, happy sound. That makes it a [[major-scale|major scale]]: the scale of C major.",
